# DsTypography docs snippets

## Default

### Show code
<DsTypography
  color="main"
  variant="body-md-reg"
>
  The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog.
</DsTypography>

### MCP manifest
const Default = () => <DsTypography variant="body-md-reg" color="main">The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog.</DsTypography>;

## Heading

### Show code
<DsTypography variant="heading3">
  The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog.
</DsTypography>

### MCP manifest
const Heading = () => <DsTypography variant="heading3">The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog.</DsTypography>;

## Color

### Show code
<DsTypography
  color="secondary"
  variant="body-md-reg"
>
  The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog.
</DsTypography>

### MCP manifest
const Color = () => <DsTypography variant="body-md-reg" color="secondary">The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog.</DsTypography>;

## Custom Color

### Show code
<DsTypography
  color="var(--color-dap-purple-600)"
  variant="body-md-reg"
>
  The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog.
</DsTypography>

### MCP manifest
const CustomColor = () => <DsTypography variant="body-md-reg" color="var(--color-dap-purple-600)">The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog.</DsTypography>;

## As Child

### Show code
{
  parameters: {
    controls: {
      disable: true
    }
  },
  render: () => <DsTypography variant="body-md-link" asChild>
            <a href="https://example.com">Link rendered via asChild</a>
        </DsTypography>
}

### MCP manifest
const AsChild = () => (
    <DsTypography variant="body-md-link" asChild>
        <a href="https://example.com">Link rendered via asChild</a>
    </DsTypography>
);

## Truncate

### Show code
<DsTypography
  truncate
  variant="body-md-reg"
>
  The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog while the sleepy cat watches from the warm windowsill nearby.
</DsTypography>

### MCP manifest
const Truncate = () => <DsTypography variant="body-md-reg" truncate>The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog while the sleepy cat watches from the warm windowsill nearby.</DsTypography>;

## Truncate Multiline

### Show code
<DsTypography
  truncate={2}
  variant="body-md-reg"
>
  The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog while the sleepy cat watches from the warm windowsill nearby.
</DsTypography>

### MCP manifest
const TruncateMultiline = () => <DsTypography variant="body-md-reg" truncate={2}>The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog while the sleepy cat watches from the warm windowsill nearby.</DsTypography>;

## Truncate With Tooltip

### Show code
<DsTypography
  tooltip
  truncate
  variant="body-md-reg"
>
  The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog while the sleepy cat watches from the warm windowsill nearby.
</DsTypography>

### MCP manifest
const TruncateWithTooltip = () => <DsTypography variant="body-md-reg" truncate tooltip>The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog while the sleepy cat watches from the warm windowsill nearby.</DsTypography>;